<header class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><h1>Privacy</h1><p class="page-lede">A short explanation of what this website measures and what it does not.</p></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="reading prose privacy-copy">
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>If analytics is enabled, it only starts after you accept the analytics choice shown on this site. It may record pages viewed, links selected, broad traffic sources, device information, approximate location, page performance and technical errors.</p>
  <p>The site does not intentionally send names, email addresses, form answers or the contents of private business conversations to analytics tools. A choice to accept or decline is stored in your browser so the site can remember it.</p>
  <h2>External services</h2>
  <p>Links to Calendly, YouTube, social networks and other websites take you to services with their own privacy practices. A booking is handled by Calendly. The newsletter form uses Kit to process your first name, email address and subscription. Kit’s form script also receives technical information such as the page URL and referrer. So that Kit records how you first reached this site, not just the page you subscribed on, your browser keeps the first outside website and campaign tags of your visit in that tab’s session storage and passes them to Kit only if you subscribe. This is separate from optional site analytics. Newsletter submission events do not include your email address.</p>
  <h2>Your choice</h2>
  <p>You can change your analytics choice on this device at any time.</p>
  <p><button class="text-button privacy-reset" type="button" data-consent-reset>Change analytics choice</button></p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For a privacy question, use the <a href="/work-with-me/#fit-call">contact route on this website</a>.</p>
</div></section>
